WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.690
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.960 --> 03:10.600
Why won't you accept that I'm trying to help?

3
03:10.680 --> 03:11.880
I don't have a father.

4
03:11.960 --> 03:13.120
If you want me to bow to you that badly…

5
03:13.200 --> 03:14.040
Kill him.

6
03:14.120 --> 03:17.040
…I'll do it at your funeral.

7
03:17.120 --> 03:18.520
‎PREVIOUSLY

8
03:18.600 --> 03:19.520
I forgive you.

9
03:20.400 --> 03:23.160
Ramil inherited everything from his father.

10
03:23.240 --> 03:24.360
We don't have to struggle anymore.

11
03:24.440 --> 03:25.800
Then go with him.

12
03:27.920 --> 03:29.480
Maybe he'll finally stop barking.

13
03:35.640 --> 03:37.160
This is the worst day of my life, Mom.

14
03:50.280 --> 03:51.280
Ramil.

15
03:54.240 --> 03:57.480
I'm glad your father is dead.

16
04:00.360 --> 04:01.600
How can you say that?

17
04:02.640 --> 04:05.880
I thought you'd be happy your father died.

18
04:06.480 --> 04:08.320
You inherited everything

19
04:08.400 --> 04:10.840
and became rich overnight.

20
04:12.880 --> 04:14.040
Now that you're rich,

21
04:14.120 --> 04:15.960
why put up with living here?

22
04:16.040 --> 04:19.800
Get out. And take your wife with you.

23
04:19.880 --> 04:21.519
I'm sick of looking at both of you.

24
04:21.600 --> 04:22.800
I'm not leaving.

25
04:24.280 --> 04:25.520
I'm staying here.

26
04:25.600 --> 04:27.480
What are you staying for?

27
04:31.480 --> 04:32.640
Mom.

28
04:34.280 --> 04:37.480
They're parasites by nature.

29
04:38.320 --> 04:40.600
They're so used to clinging to other people.

30
04:41.200 --> 04:42.680
They need a collar

31
04:42.760 --> 04:46.400
and someone constantly yanking the leash.

32
04:46.920 --> 04:48.560
They can't live on their own.

33
04:50.520 --> 04:54.800
Ramil chose to stay here because he wants to help finish Grandpa's work.

34
04:56.120 --> 04:59.440
That's right. I could go back and work for my father's company now.

35
05:00.280 --> 05:01.920
But I'm staying here

36
05:03.120 --> 05:05.800
until I finish Mr. Pichai's work. Then I'll leave.

37
05:05.880 --> 05:07.960
-You don't have to-- -Fine.

38
05:09.240 --> 05:10.840
Go back to doing your job.

39
05:11.880 --> 05:14.840
But you better earn your keep in this house.

40
05:18.920 --> 05:22.800
Miss Hathaya, the hospital just brought Mr. Pichai home.

41
05:22.880 --> 05:24.080
Okay, Aunt Ann.

42
05:27.480 --> 05:28.800
Let's go see Grandpa.

43
05:44.640 --> 05:46.880
You shouldn't have let him get involved again.

44
05:47.720 --> 05:49.360
Raiwin asked me to, Mom.

45
05:49.880 --> 05:51.480
Ramil inherited a lot of money.

46
05:51.560 --> 05:53.520
We need to be nice to him now.

47
05:53.600 --> 05:56.000
Maybe we can get something out of him.

48
05:59.400 --> 06:01.000
Madam.

49
06:02.400 --> 06:06.600
Mr. Pichai is back. Aren't you afraid he'll tell everyone the truth?

50
06:08.440 --> 06:11.280
Grandpa is basically unresponsive. I'm not afraid of him.

51
06:12.800 --> 06:14.040
You're the one

52
06:14.840 --> 06:16.160
who needs to zip it.

53
06:18.040 --> 06:19.680
If you tell anyone…

54
06:21.120 --> 06:22.800
I'll kill you.

55
06:22.880 --> 06:27.320
Yes. I'll seal my mouth shut with cement.

56
06:44.640 --> 06:48.200
Grandpa, you're home now.

57
06:53.000 --> 06:56.600
Ramil and I will take care of you.

58
06:58.040 --> 06:59.720
You have to stay strong.

59
07:00.480 --> 07:04.040
Soon you'll be able to talk and walk again.

60
07:07.920 --> 07:10.120
I'll take the best possible care of you, sir.

61
07:11.320 --> 07:14.440
The development is almost finished too.

62
07:15.520 --> 07:17.600
We're waiting for you to come inspect it.

63
07:27.920 --> 07:29.480
You two can go to work now.

64
07:35.600 --> 07:37.200
Grandpa just got home.

65
07:37.720 --> 07:40.200
I want to take the day off to look after him.

66
07:40.960 --> 07:42.880
Go to work, Hathaya.

67
07:43.400 --> 07:46.520
Mom and I will take care of Grandpa here.

68
07:49.360 --> 07:50.280
Go.

69
07:51.000 --> 07:52.760
I'm his daughter-in-law,

70
07:52.840 --> 07:56.720
and Chayanee is his beloved granddaughter. We'll take care of him.

71
08:03.680 --> 08:06.360
Aunt Ann, please take care of him.

72
08:06.440 --> 08:07.680
Of course.

73
08:32.120 --> 08:35.440
I really don't want to leave. I'm worried about Grandpa.

74
08:35.960 --> 08:39.760
It's okay. Aunt Ann is taking care of him. Don't worry.

75
08:42.480 --> 08:43.760
We need to finish the work

76
08:44.280 --> 08:46.640
so Grandpa will be happy. Okay?

77
08:56.160 --> 08:57.160
You can leave now.

78
08:57.240 --> 08:59.240
I'm staying to take care of him.

79
08:59.320 --> 09:02.000
My daughter and I will stay with Father.

80
09:02.080 --> 09:06.240
But Miss Hathaya told me not to leave his side.

81
09:06.320 --> 09:09.840
How dare you? Who pays your salary?

82
09:09.920 --> 09:11.720
Talk back to me one more time

83
09:11.800 --> 09:15.160
and I'll fire you. Go make Father some food.

84
09:24.440 --> 09:25.880
-Chamoi. -Yes?

85
09:25.960 --> 09:29.560
Stand guard. Don't let her stick her nose in here right now.

86
09:29.640 --> 09:30.760
Yes, madam.

87
09:40.360 --> 09:41.760
Grandpa.

88
09:43.440 --> 09:45.320
I'm sorry.

89
09:46.320 --> 09:48.960
I didn't mean to hurt you.

90
09:49.920 --> 09:54.160
I'll make up for what I did by taking care of you.

91
09:58.000 --> 10:00.400
I won't hurt you.

92
10:01.800 --> 10:04.360
I want you to see me succeed.

93
10:07.320 --> 10:08.760
Soon…

94
10:10.720 --> 10:13.960
you'll see that this granddaughter you love

95
10:16.040 --> 10:19.400
is a thousand times better than that parasite.

96
10:24.120 --> 10:25.360
Father.

97
10:25.880 --> 10:28.400
Stay with us long enough to see your granddaughter succeed.

98
10:38.880 --> 10:41.080
-Papang. -Daddy!

99
10:41.160 --> 10:43.440
Papang. Papang.

100
10:48.280 --> 10:52.320
I missed you to the moon and back, Daddy.

101
10:52.400 --> 10:56.720
I missed you too. But what does that even mean?

102
10:56.800 --> 11:00.440
I mean more than anything in the world.

103
11:01.520 --> 11:04.640
Papang, who brought you here?

104
11:05.160 --> 11:07.640
-Mommy. -Mommy?

105
11:07.720 --> 11:10.680
Where is she? Did she already leave?

106
11:10.760 --> 11:13.680
Mommy is taking care of Great-Grandpa Pichai.

107
11:13.760 --> 11:14.960
What?

108
11:22.440 --> 11:24.040
You're back?

109
11:25.160 --> 11:28.240
I'll take over with Grandpa now. Thank you.

110
11:28.320 --> 11:30.880
It's fine. I can take care of him.

111
11:31.480 --> 11:34.040
I used to look after my own grandfather when he was bedridden.

112
11:34.120 --> 11:36.640
It would be better to let his granddaughter care for him.

113
11:39.280 --> 11:42.680
As for you, come talk to me.

114
11:47.240 --> 11:48.400
Papang.

115
11:48.480 --> 11:52.240
Go read Great-Grandpa a story, okay?

116
11:52.320 --> 11:53.640
Okay.

117
11:59.720 --> 12:00.880
Come on.

118
12:03.440 --> 12:05.160
You brought Papang here. Now you can go.

119
12:05.680 --> 12:08.320
I'll take care of him. How many days will you be working?

120
12:08.960 --> 12:11.880
-When are you coming back to get him? -I'm not going anywhere.

121
12:11.960 --> 12:14.840
I brought him here because we're both staying.

122
12:14.920 --> 12:16.160
No.

123
12:17.160 --> 12:20.080
Think about it carefully.

124
12:20.160 --> 12:22.240
If you and Hathaya go to work,

125
12:22.320 --> 12:26.040
are you really going to leave Mr. Pichai with the maids all day?

126
12:26.120 --> 12:28.000
I don't think that's appropriate.

127
12:28.080 --> 12:30.760
I can volunteer to take care of him myself.

128
12:30.840 --> 12:32.120
And I think

129
12:32.840 --> 12:37.080
a child in the house might make Mr. Pichai happier too.

130
12:38.960 --> 12:41.520
Papang loves talking and asking questions.

131
12:41.600 --> 12:44.080
That can help stimulate his awareness.

132
12:44.160 --> 12:46.960
Even if he can't respond verbally,

133
12:47.040 --> 12:48.960
he can still understand through feelings.

134
12:49.040 --> 12:52.360
It may help improve his emotional well-being.

135
12:52.440 --> 12:55.160
And I think

136
12:55.240 --> 12:58.920
before long, Mr. Pichai will be able to talk and walk again.

137
12:59.000 --> 13:01.400
Thanks for the advice.

138
13:02.160 --> 13:06.280
But no. I can figure something out myself. I don't need to depend on you.

139
13:06.360 --> 13:07.800
Why?

140
13:08.960 --> 13:12.840
Do you hate me? Or are you afraid you'll lose?

141
13:15.040 --> 13:17.040
Afraid you'll give in to your own feelings?

142
13:18.520 --> 13:19.760
I already told you.

143
13:20.400 --> 13:22.600
I'm only being Papang's father.

144
13:23.360 --> 13:25.000
I've never had feelings for you.

145
13:25.600 --> 13:28.400
You won't give me even one chance?

146
13:29.560 --> 13:31.640
Let Nuchwara stay here.

147
13:34.680 --> 13:39.040
I don't want Papang separated from his mother. Plus, he's good for Grandpa.

148
13:40.080 --> 13:42.480
Accept Nuchwara's offer.

149
13:46.760 --> 13:50.200
Even if I agree, the owners of the house won't.

150
13:51.160 --> 13:54.000
I'll talk to Aunt Liu and Chayanee myself.

151
13:54.760 --> 13:56.640
I'm going to stay with my son.

152
14:07.760 --> 14:08.600
What are you doing?

153
14:08.680 --> 14:11.600
You know Liu and Chayanee will never agree to this.

154
14:11.680 --> 14:12.960
I know.

155
14:13.040 --> 14:15.800
Then why would you do it?

156
14:15.880 --> 14:17.800
I have my own way.

157
14:19.720 --> 14:22.720
I'm surprised you asked to meet me privately.

158
14:23.400 --> 14:25.560
This must be something big and important.

159
14:26.680 --> 14:27.800
It is.

160
14:28.440 --> 14:30.960
It's very important for Grandpa.

161
14:31.040 --> 14:33.680
If it matters that much to you,

162
14:33.760 --> 14:37.400
I'm happy to help. What do you need?

163
14:38.800 --> 14:40.000
Well…

164
14:41.040 --> 14:45.240
I want you to talk to Chayanee for me.

165
14:46.480 --> 14:47.640
Ask her

166
14:48.160 --> 14:52.000
to let Nuchwara and Papang stay at the house.

167
14:57.280 --> 15:01.280
I can't help you with that.

168
15:02.520 --> 15:06.000
I know it makes you uncomfortable,

169
15:06.080 --> 15:10.160
but Chayanee only listens to you.

170
15:12.040 --> 15:13.080
And

171
15:13.840 --> 15:15.920
you once told Ramil

172
15:16.440 --> 15:20.000
that you wanted to prove you were sincere.

173
15:20.800 --> 15:23.160
This could be a good opportunity.

174
15:23.680 --> 15:25.160
If you help,

175
15:25.680 --> 15:28.640
I think Ramil may finally forgive you.

176
15:29.520 --> 15:31.560
You shouldn't have asked him for help.

177
15:32.400 --> 15:36.480
I had to. I want Grandpa to recover as quickly as possible.

178
15:37.000 --> 15:38.840
And I'm also doing this for Papang.

179
15:39.680 --> 15:40.920
What's Papang to do with it?

180
15:41.000 --> 15:45.800
I want to use this opportunity to let Raiwin and Papang spend time together.

181
15:46.400 --> 15:48.840
Are you going to reveal that they're father and son?

182
15:50.440 --> 15:52.640
I just want Raiwin to accept the truth

183
15:53.240 --> 15:54.720
and take responsibility for Papang.

184
15:55.240 --> 15:58.920
But if he still refuses, I won't demand anything.

185
15:59.000 --> 16:03.640
I just want father and son to have a chance to be close to each other.

186
16:04.320 --> 16:07.040
Did he agree to help?

187
16:08.360 --> 16:09.760
I'm not sure.

188
16:14.080 --> 16:15.280
Miss Hathaya.

189
16:15.360 --> 16:18.880
Madam Liu and Miss Chayanee are back. Something terrible is happening.

190
16:23.760 --> 16:26.200
Get out of this house. Get out!

191
16:27.400 --> 16:31.280
Papang, say hello to Grandma and Auntie.

192
16:31.920 --> 16:34.320
Hello, Grandma. Hello, Auntie.

193
16:34.400 --> 16:35.600
Don't say hello to me.

194
16:37.520 --> 16:40.440
-Get out. -I'm not related to either of you.

195
16:40.520 --> 16:43.120
Get the hell out of my house right now.

196
16:45.280 --> 16:48.640
It's okay. Don't be scared, sweetheart.

197
16:49.320 --> 16:51.040
Papang, remember this.

198
16:52.320 --> 16:57.000
Shouting at people like this is very rude

199
16:57.080 --> 16:59.360
and aggressive.

200
16:59.440 --> 17:01.560
If you behaved this badly,

201
17:02.160 --> 17:04.000
nobody would want to be your friend.

202
17:04.760 --> 17:07.280
People would say your parents never taught you any manners.

203
17:07.359 --> 17:11.319
Madam, she's insulting you without saying it directly.

204
17:11.400 --> 17:15.520
Why are you standing there like an idiot? Drag them out of my house right now.

205
17:15.599 --> 17:18.920
-Get out. Come on. -Don't touch me.

206
17:19.000 --> 17:21.240
I said get out. Come on.

207
17:21.319 --> 17:23.480
-Right now. -Don't touch my son.

208
17:23.560 --> 17:25.680
Let go of him.

209
17:26.920 --> 17:28.960
-Give me the kid. -Let go.

210
17:30.840 --> 17:32.520
I said let go.

211
17:33.640 --> 17:34.920
You're hurting me.

212
17:35.000 --> 17:37.520
-Let go of my son right now. -Okay!

213
17:37.600 --> 17:39.280
Shut up!

214
17:39.880 --> 17:41.240
Your mother insulted me

215
17:41.760 --> 17:44.440
and my mother. She did something wrong,

216
17:44.520 --> 17:48.080
so she needs to be punished. But I don't feel like punishing you.

217
17:48.680 --> 17:50.160
I'd rather punish your son.

218
17:53.000 --> 17:55.040
-Come here. -Don't touch my son. Let go.

219
17:56.320 --> 17:59.360
-Get out of here. -Don't touch my son. Let go.

220
17:59.440 --> 18:02.120
-Stop! Don't. I said stop. -Stay back!

221
18:04.160 --> 18:06.200
Why did you get involved?

222
18:06.280 --> 18:07.800
Papang is my son.

223
18:07.880 --> 18:10.600
If you hurt him, I'll make sure you answer for it.

224
18:10.680 --> 18:12.080
You think I'm scared of you?

225
18:12.600 --> 18:16.160
Have you forgotten that my daughter and I are in charge of this house?

226
18:16.240 --> 18:19.280
Aunt Liu, please.

227
18:19.360 --> 18:22.360
I'm the one who asked Nuchwara and Papang to stay here.

228
18:22.960 --> 18:26.080
And what gives you the right to invite anyone you want into this house?

229
18:26.160 --> 18:28.680
You think this is some kind of shelter?

230
18:29.200 --> 18:30.680
Get out.

231
18:32.080 --> 18:34.480
-Aunt Chamoi. -Yes, Miss Chayanee.

232
18:35.200 --> 18:38.320
Call the police and have them drag all of them out.

233
18:38.400 --> 18:41.760
Of course. I'll call 1669.

234
18:41.840 --> 18:44.880
You idiot. Are you trying to call an ambulance to collect your own body?

235
18:44.960 --> 18:46.160
Dial 191.

236
18:46.240 --> 18:50.000
Right. I'll call the whole police station if I have to.

237
18:51.040 --> 18:53.400
Please don't call them.

238
18:59.800 --> 19:02.400
I'd like Nuchwara and her son to stay here.

239
19:02.480 --> 19:04.960
Why do you want her to stay here?

240
19:05.760 --> 19:08.600
I know you love Grandpa and worry about him.

241
19:09.640 --> 19:13.640
Nuchwara is experienced in caring for bedridden patients. She could help.

242
19:14.240 --> 19:16.360
We don't need that woman.

243
19:16.880 --> 19:21.200
Chayanee and I were already planning to hire a nurse for Father.

244
19:21.280 --> 19:22.440
Aunt Liu,

245
19:23.200 --> 19:26.400
Nuchwara really does have experience caring for bedridden patients.

246
19:27.160 --> 19:29.240
And Mr. Pichai loves Papang.

247
19:29.760 --> 19:32.880
Having Papang around will make him happy. That can help his health too.

248
19:35.840 --> 19:38.000
-But I think-- -Please.

249
19:41.040 --> 19:42.200
Please, honey.

250
19:49.080 --> 19:50.600
Please.

251
19:55.760 --> 19:57.360
Fine. I'll agree.

252
19:59.200 --> 20:01.400
But you have to do something for me.

253
20:03.600 --> 20:06.400
Anything. What do you want?

254
20:09.960 --> 20:12.160
You have to move in here with me.

255
20:29.640 --> 20:30.760
Well?

256
20:32.640 --> 20:35.520
If you don't move in here with me,

257
20:37.040 --> 20:38.560
I'm throwing them out.

258
20:51.080 --> 20:52.680
I already want to be with you.

259
20:53.960 --> 20:56.960
Once Mr. Pichai gets better, I'll have my father arrange the wedding.

260
20:58.600 --> 20:59.880
You said it.

261
21:14.200 --> 21:18.800
What are you all standing around for? Hathaya.

262
21:18.880 --> 21:20.840
Take them to the workers' quarters.

263
21:21.800 --> 21:25.080
Come on, Papang. Come with Daddy.

264
21:27.920 --> 21:31.200
Chayanee, sweetheart. Tone it down.

265
21:40.520 --> 21:41.760
I'm going now, Mom.

266
21:41.840 --> 21:42.960
Chayanee, sweetheart.

267
21:43.040 --> 21:46.200
Don't lose yourself over a man.

268
21:46.280 --> 21:48.040
You'll end up in trouble.

269
21:48.120 --> 21:50.400
That's right, Miss Chayanee.

270
21:50.920 --> 21:53.680
Giving in to a man too much can ruin your life.

271
21:53.760 --> 21:55.480
I've seen it happen plenty of times.

272
21:57.280 --> 22:01.880
Aunt Chamoi, the man you're talking about is my husband-to-be.

273
22:04.920 --> 22:06.200
-I'm off, Mom. -All right.

274
22:08.560 --> 22:10.720
-Ready to go? -Yes.

275
22:44.200 --> 22:45.760
Where are you going?

276
22:46.360 --> 22:47.760
Where's Chayanee's room?

277
22:47.840 --> 22:49.920
What are you planning?

278
22:50.000 --> 22:53.640
I'm bringing food.

279
22:54.240 --> 22:58.720
If I were the boss and had a stupid maid like you,

280
22:58.800 --> 23:02.640
I would've fired you long ago. Did you forget

281
23:02.720 --> 23:05.080
Raiwin is staying with Miss Chayanee?

282
23:05.160 --> 23:08.480
Go make another serving. I didn't make this for your boss.

283
23:08.560 --> 23:10.200
I made it for Raiwin alone.

284
23:10.280 --> 23:12.040
What are you thinking?

285
23:12.120 --> 23:14.640
Trying to steal the boss's husband

286
23:14.720 --> 23:16.880
so you can be the subdistrict chief's wife?

287
23:16.960 --> 23:18.880
-Think whatever you want. -Stop at once.

288
23:19.640 --> 23:22.360
Mr. Raiwin loves Miss Chayanee very much.

289
23:22.440 --> 23:25.080
He would never look twice at someone like you.

290
23:25.160 --> 23:26.240
Give this to Raiwin.

291
23:26.320 --> 23:28.360
Who do you think you are?

292
23:28.440 --> 23:31.160
You keep calling him by his first name. Call him Mr. Raiwin.

293
23:31.240 --> 23:34.240
Give this to Raiwin for me.

294
23:34.320 --> 23:38.360
Mr. Raiwin isn't here. He already left for work.

295
23:38.440 --> 23:41.800
Where are you taking that?

296
23:41.880 --> 23:45.520
I didn't bring it for your boss. If Raiwin isn't here,

297
23:46.040 --> 23:47.920
I'll feed it to the dog.

298
23:48.000 --> 23:50.560
Oh my God.

299
23:50.640 --> 23:52.480
Madam!

300
24:00.720 --> 24:04.360
What do you want for lunch? I'll go get it.

301
24:05.920 --> 24:06.760
Anything is fine.

302
24:07.360 --> 24:10.040
That is really broad.

303
24:10.120 --> 24:14.200
Can you narrow it down? Rice or noodles?

304
24:14.280 --> 24:17.600
I'm tired of rice. And noodles

305
24:18.120 --> 24:19.000
never fill me up.

306
24:19.840 --> 24:21.040
Then what do you want?

307
24:22.480 --> 24:23.680
Can I eat you?

308
24:29.040 --> 24:30.000
I'm kidding.

309
24:30.720 --> 24:33.600
Don't look at me like that.

310
24:34.160 --> 24:36.440
Let's get something from the place by the entrance.

311
24:36.520 --> 24:38.640
Made-to-order food. Let's go.

312
24:38.720 --> 24:41.120
I already made food for everyone.

313
24:42.720 --> 24:44.640
Plenty of food, boss.

314
24:45.480 --> 24:48.440
You really didn't have to make all this. I can buy food myself.

315
24:49.200 --> 24:52.320
Food from outside is hard to trust these days.

316
24:52.400 --> 24:54.200
Veggies are sprayed with chemicals.

317
24:54.280 --> 24:58.400
I made this myself, so I know it's safe.

318
24:58.480 --> 25:01.160
These are all your favorites.

319
25:04.440 --> 25:06.600
Try this. I'll feed you.

320
25:06.680 --> 25:08.880
It's okay. I can eat by myself.

321
25:14.120 --> 25:17.080
Tofu. Good protein.

322
25:20.760 --> 25:21.840
Easy to digest.

323
25:22.960 --> 25:24.720
Here. Let me feed you.

324
25:25.320 --> 25:28.960
No, it's okay, Nuch. I can eat by myself.

325
25:32.360 --> 25:33.480
Eat some fish.

326
25:34.920 --> 25:36.480
Maybe it'll make you smarter.

327
25:46.160 --> 25:48.480
Want some egg? A nice big one.

328
26:12.560 --> 26:13.520
Have some soup.

329
26:15.080 --> 26:16.720
So you don't choke.

330
26:36.360 --> 26:37.840
My plate is already full.

331
26:37.920 --> 26:39.800
I don't think I can keep up.

332
26:40.600 --> 26:41.960
Actually,

333
26:42.480 --> 26:44.520
I should go to the bathroom.

334
26:44.600 --> 26:47.720
Max. Didn't you say you had to pee?

335
26:47.800 --> 26:48.680
Let's go together.

336
26:49.720 --> 26:50.920
When did I say that?

337
26:51.000 --> 26:53.520
Just now. You forgot already?

338
26:53.600 --> 26:55.680
You said you had to pee. Let's go.

339
26:55.760 --> 26:57.880
-Come on. -Right.

340
26:57.960 --> 26:59.360
I really have to go.

341
26:59.440 --> 27:01.920
Where's the bathroom, boss?

342
27:07.240 --> 27:08.360
What do you want?

343
27:10.040 --> 27:11.320
Ramil. That's what I want.

344
27:11.400 --> 27:14.000
He may be the man you love,

345
27:15.480 --> 27:17.520
but you're not the woman he loves.

346
27:17.600 --> 27:20.880
Are you a psychic? How do you know how he feels?

347
27:21.400 --> 27:23.360
I've been with him a long time.

348
27:23.880 --> 27:27.520
We're together every day. I know him well.

349
27:29.160 --> 27:32.880
Let's not argue over something so pointless.

350
27:32.960 --> 27:35.680
Who knows him better doesn't matter.

351
27:36.600 --> 27:40.640
What matters is who his heart belongs to.

352
27:46.600 --> 27:48.640
War is about to break out, boss.

353
27:50.240 --> 27:51.320
You're exaggerating.

354
27:52.120 --> 27:53.080
Then,

355
27:53.160 --> 27:57.480
why don't you pick a side before the war starts?

356
27:58.960 --> 27:59.920
I'm not choosing.

357
28:00.000 --> 28:04.800
What? Why not? Are you choosing violence?

358
28:05.600 --> 28:07.200
I want to know for sure

359
28:07.280 --> 28:09.560
if Hathaya is only protecting me

360
28:10.760 --> 28:12.040
or if she really has feelings.

361
28:16.600 --> 28:18.200
Are you planning to compete with me?

362
28:20.560 --> 28:23.720
I'm not trying to compete. I'm protecting him.

363
28:24.320 --> 28:26.840
I'm not going to let you hurt him again.

364
28:27.360 --> 28:29.960
That isn't your responsibility.

365
28:31.200 --> 28:33.440
He doesn't belong to you.

366
28:35.680 --> 28:38.560
What if I want him to?

367
28:42.120 --> 28:46.080
Then I guess you and I will have to fight for him.

368
28:51.320 --> 28:55.560
Aren't you eating? There's plenty left. You barely ate anything earlier.

369
28:59.520 --> 29:01.880
I don't share with others.

370
29:14.000 --> 29:16.440
I'm here to see the chief. Is he here?

371
29:17.040 --> 29:18.920
He went out to inspect some work.

372
29:19.680 --> 29:22.960
You're lying. I saw Raiwin's car parked outside.

373
29:23.840 --> 29:26.240
The Chief took an official vehicle today.

374
29:27.760 --> 29:29.120
I'll wait in his office.

375
29:29.840 --> 29:32.840
Then please wait in the reception room.

376
29:32.920 --> 29:34.160
I'll bring you some coffee.

377
29:35.080 --> 29:36.680
I'm waiting in Raiwin's office.

378
29:42.080 --> 29:42.960
What happened?

379
29:43.560 --> 29:45.080
A showdown is about to happen.

380
29:45.760 --> 29:49.000
Another woman came earlier, claiming she was close to the chief.

381
29:49.080 --> 29:50.080
She's waiting in there.

382
29:51.240 --> 29:55.120
No wonder the locals say the chief's girlfriend is crazy jealous.

383
29:55.200 --> 29:57.400
She attacks any woman who gets near him.

384
29:57.480 --> 30:00.720
What do we do?

385
30:01.240 --> 30:03.120
Call the chief to come back now.

386
30:12.040 --> 30:13.360
What are you doing in here?

387
30:15.280 --> 30:18.120
Open your eyes and look.

388
30:19.440 --> 30:21.160
This is my boyfriend's office.

389
30:21.240 --> 30:22.680
Get out.

390
30:26.200 --> 30:29.720
Is there some rule saying a citizen isn't allowed

391
30:29.800 --> 30:31.520
to bring flowers to the chief?

392
30:31.600 --> 30:35.200
I just wanted to thank him for working so hard for the people,

393
30:35.280 --> 30:37.040
so I brought some flowers. That's all.

394
30:42.760 --> 30:44.080
Flowers?

395
30:48.280 --> 30:49.680
What kind of flowers?

396
30:52.960 --> 30:54.640
Roses…

397
30:56.120 --> 30:58.000
don't suit you.

398
30:58.520 --> 31:02.720
You're just cheap trash.

399
31:05.120 --> 31:06.720
Then what flower suits you?

400
31:08.960 --> 31:10.200
Me?

401
31:11.400 --> 31:15.400
Sweet peas suit me well, since I'm Raiwin's sweetheart.

402
31:19.880 --> 31:21.760
What are you laughing at?

403
31:25.640 --> 31:28.160
I'm laughing because of your comparison.

404
31:30.600 --> 31:31.680
The only flower

405
31:32.400 --> 31:36.000
that really suits you is one from the thorn trees in hell.

406
31:37.160 --> 31:39.320
How dare you insult me?

407
31:40.040 --> 31:41.920
You're climbing a thorn tree for adultery.

408
31:42.560 --> 31:44.480
You're the other woman. Didn't you realize?

409
31:44.560 --> 31:48.600
What the hell are you talking about? Get out. Get out right now.

410
31:51.760 --> 31:52.840
I said get out.

411
31:56.680 --> 31:57.640
You're not leaving?

412
31:58.760 --> 31:59.680
What happened?

413
31:59.760 --> 32:03.480
Chief, hurry and stop them. They're yelling so loudly in your office.

414
32:03.560 --> 32:06.760
With that much noise, they're definitely fighting.

415
32:07.480 --> 32:11.320
Fine. I'll drag you out myself.

416
32:11.400 --> 32:12.280
Go.

417
32:12.360 --> 32:16.680
Take your bag too. Get out. Go.

418
32:16.760 --> 32:19.120
Help! Help me!

419
32:19.200 --> 32:21.520
-Someone help! -Stop.

420
32:21.600 --> 32:24.480
Chayanee. Let go. Let her go.

421
32:27.120 --> 32:28.920
Chayanee…

422
32:30.960 --> 32:32.680
Chayanee is hurting me.

423
32:38.680 --> 32:39.720
You lying bitch.

424
32:42.280 --> 32:44.160
I'll slap you to death myself.

425
32:45.120 --> 32:48.520
Chayanee. Enough. Stop.

426
32:51.480 --> 32:54.640
You pushed me? And you're protecting her?

427
32:56.240 --> 32:57.400
Get a grip.

428
32:58.320 --> 33:01.080
Do you even realize what you're doing?

429
33:01.160 --> 33:02.640
She came into your office

430
33:02.720 --> 33:05.160
trying to seduce you. Can't you see that?

431
33:07.920 --> 33:09.160
That's not true.

432
33:11.960 --> 33:15.960
I only wanted to encourage you

433
33:16.040 --> 33:18.600
because I've seen how hard you work for the people.

434
33:19.600 --> 33:23.520
So I came to arrange some flowers for you. But…

435
33:27.000 --> 33:29.840
Chayanee misunderstood and thought I was trying to seduce you.

436
33:30.960 --> 33:32.440
So she…

437
33:34.480 --> 33:35.560
slapped me…

438
33:37.440 --> 33:38.640
pulled my hair…

439
33:40.240 --> 33:42.240
and threw flowers at me.

440
33:47.040 --> 33:47.920
You lying bitch.

441
33:50.560 --> 33:51.400
That's not true.

442
33:52.160 --> 33:55.200
She started it.

443
33:55.280 --> 33:56.640
She insulted me.

444
33:56.720 --> 33:59.280
She called me an adulteress who belongs on the thorn tree.

445
33:59.360 --> 34:01.680
She was saying all kinds of crazy things about me.

446
34:02.640 --> 34:04.680
What exactly did you mean by that?

447
34:04.760 --> 34:09.560
Tell everyone why you called me

448
34:09.639 --> 34:11.719
an adulteress. Say it.

449
34:21.080 --> 34:24.120
I think this is all a misunderstanding.

450
34:25.800 --> 34:27.440
Let's end it here.

451
34:29.520 --> 34:32.080
Nuch, go home.

452
34:32.159 --> 34:33.400
Okay.

453
34:34.520 --> 34:36.120
I won't bother you again.

454
34:37.199 --> 34:38.719
I don't want to cause you trouble.

455
34:46.360 --> 34:48.040
I think

456
34:49.520 --> 34:50.800
you misunderstood me.

457
34:53.920 --> 34:55.159
So,

458
34:56.040 --> 34:57.520
let's just end this here.

459
35:15.040 --> 35:18.120
This is only the beginning. See you in round two.

460
35:21.640 --> 35:24.840
-You! -Hey! Let her go.

461
35:24.920 --> 35:27.320
-Let her go. -You lying bitch!

462
35:27.400 --> 35:29.640
Enough. Let her go.

463
35:29.720 --> 35:32.560
-Let her go. Go, Nuch. -Let go.

464
35:32.640 --> 35:35.160
Chayanee. Enough.

465
35:36.000 --> 35:37.360
Enough.

466
35:38.280 --> 35:40.080
We're going home.

467
35:40.160 --> 35:42.440
-Come on. -Let go.

468
35:43.360 --> 35:44.440
Delete that video.

469
35:44.520 --> 35:46.440
This was just a misunderstanding.

470
35:46.960 --> 35:48.240
Come on. Let's go home.

471
35:48.760 --> 35:50.440
We're going home now.

472
35:54.840 --> 35:56.640
The chief wants us to delete the video.

473
35:57.560 --> 36:01.400
What a shame. If we posted this, it would break the internet.

474
36:02.840 --> 36:06.120
You're the only one who agreed to delete it. I didn't.

475
36:06.880 --> 36:09.200
Don't you feel sorry for the chief?

476
36:09.800 --> 36:14.560
No. His father was already trying to pocket kickbacks before him.

477
36:15.400 --> 36:18.000
People like this need to learn a lesson.

478
36:40.520 --> 36:46.600
Little cuckoo bird

479
36:48.000 --> 36:53.320
You left your egg for Mother Crow to hatch

480
36:54.560 --> 36:59.440
Mother Crow grew to love it

481
37:00.680 --> 37:05.720
Thinking it was her own child

482
37:07.320 --> 37:11.040
She brought rice and food

483
37:12.160 --> 37:15.880
Fed it and cared for it

484
37:17.720 --> 37:21.480
Kept it safe inside the nest

485
37:23.520 --> 37:28.120
And always brought it something to eat

486
37:33.440 --> 37:35.360
You sang him

487
37:36.120 --> 37:37.640
right into a good dream.

488
37:40.640 --> 37:44.120
Why do you always sing

489
37:44.920 --> 37:47.000
that cuckoo lullaby to him?

490
37:48.680 --> 37:49.880
When I was little,

491
37:51.640 --> 37:53.600
Grandpa used to sing it to me.

492
37:54.600 --> 37:56.920
So I've known it since I was a child.

493
37:57.880 --> 38:00.120
And I like what it means.

494
38:02.200 --> 38:03.760
This song

495
38:04.680 --> 38:07.440
speaks for a lot of people.

496
38:09.720 --> 38:12.560
Even when people aren't family by blood,

497
38:14.640 --> 38:16.920
love and the bond between them

498
38:18.240 --> 38:20.240
can still make them family.

499
38:28.720 --> 38:31.600
Aunt Ann, is Daddy back?

500
38:31.680 --> 38:34.600
-Where is he? -In Grandpa's room.

501
38:34.680 --> 38:37.840
I'm going to read a story to him and Daddy.

502
38:39.120 --> 38:40.920
That's sweet.

503
38:46.280 --> 38:47.680
I like

504
38:48.560 --> 38:49.600
that cuckoo lullaby.

505
38:51.200 --> 38:52.560
It makes me think

506
38:53.800 --> 38:55.400
of Papang and me.

507
38:57.080 --> 38:58.920
I agreed to be Papang's father.

508
39:00.240 --> 39:01.640
I've raised him for so long…

509
39:03.320 --> 39:04.800
that I truly feel…

510
39:06.400 --> 39:08.320
like I'm his real father.

511
39:09.680 --> 39:13.960
If someone tried to take Papang away from me now, I wouldn't allow it.

512
39:16.640 --> 39:19.280
I'll help you take care of Papang and protect him too.

513
39:20.920 --> 39:22.040
Thank you.

514
39:26.840 --> 39:27.960
Papang.

515
39:30.800 --> 39:32.200
Papang.

516
39:32.280 --> 39:34.240
How long have you been standing there?

517
39:36.560 --> 39:39.320
I just got here.

518
39:42.480 --> 39:46.680
I'm going to read Great-Grandpa a story.

519
40:15.720 --> 40:19.240
Madam. Madam. Miss Chayanee is famous now.

520
40:20.320 --> 40:23.880
Really? Was she interviewed on the news? Let me see.

521
40:23.960 --> 40:27.960
No. Someone posted a video of Miss Chayanee and Nuchwara fighting

522
40:28.040 --> 40:29.960
at the Subdistrict Office. It's going viral.

523
40:30.040 --> 40:34.080
Delete it. Go after every copy and get them all taken down.

524
40:34.160 --> 40:37.160
-Quickly. -There's no way to delete all of them.

525
40:37.240 --> 40:38.800
It's all over the internet.

526
40:38.880 --> 40:40.520
Delete everything.

527
40:40.600 --> 40:43.920
Chayanee. Stop right now. We need to settle this.

528
40:46.160 --> 40:50.160
Do you realize what you've done? I told you not to go to the Subdistrict Office.

529
40:50.240 --> 40:53.840
You keep yelling at me. Why don't you tell Nuchwara to stay away instead?

530
40:53.920 --> 40:55.480
Why do you care so much about her

531
40:55.560 --> 40:58.640
and treat her with so much respect when she's just Ramil's wife?

532
40:58.720 --> 41:00.960
What if I'm more than that?

533
41:03.640 --> 41:06.960
What do you mean? What are you trying to tell me?

534
41:07.560 --> 41:08.520
Nuch.

535
41:09.040 --> 41:12.760
Go upstairs and take care of your son. Please. Don't start another fight.

536
41:18.680 --> 41:20.320
If you ask me…

537
41:22.240 --> 41:23.560
I'll do it.

538
41:24.760 --> 41:26.600
-Hey. -Mom, look at her.

539
41:26.680 --> 41:27.760
Look at her with Raiwin.

540
41:27.840 --> 41:30.120
-This has gone too far, Nuchwara. -What?

541
41:30.800 --> 41:32.400
I can't hold his hand?

542
41:33.200 --> 41:35.680
Then what part of Raiwin would you rather I touch?

543
41:35.760 --> 41:37.040
That's enough.

544
41:39.600 --> 41:40.800
What?

545
41:42.680 --> 41:45.120
-Enough. Stop. -Stop.

546
41:47.680 --> 41:48.800
Enough.

547
41:51.720 --> 41:54.360
Aunt Ann, take Papang upstairs first.

548
41:54.440 --> 41:55.880
-Okay. -Go. Quickly.

549
41:57.400 --> 41:58.240
-Stop. -Ramil.

550
42:00.120 --> 42:01.720
-Enough. Stop. -Chayanee.

551
42:03.960 --> 42:05.320
You too.

552
42:05.400 --> 42:07.160
You're protecting her.

553
42:07.240 --> 42:09.040
I'm not protecting her.

554
42:09.640 --> 42:11.680
But you've gone too far.

555
42:11.760 --> 42:14.880
That video is already being shared everywhere.

556
42:14.960 --> 42:18.880
It damages my reputation too. How am I supposed to govern people?

557
42:18.960 --> 42:20.720
Then I'll go after

558
42:20.800 --> 42:23.480
-everyone who posted it. -Enough.

559
42:23.560 --> 42:27.120
You never blame yourself. You blame everyone else for everything.

560
42:30.000 --> 42:31.560
You're yelling at me

561
42:31.640 --> 42:34.240
when all of this happened because of her.

562
42:35.800 --> 42:40.040
If you hadn't asked me to let her stay, I never would have kept her here.

563
42:43.640 --> 42:45.240
Answer me.

564
42:46.760 --> 42:49.840
Why are you always protecting her?

565
42:50.520 --> 42:53.920
Is she Ramil's wife or yours?

566
42:56.720 --> 42:58.160
Answer me!

567
43:04.280 --> 43:05.800
I said answer me.

568
43:09.760 --> 43:11.240
If no one else is going to say it,

569
43:11.760 --> 43:14.520
-I will. The truth is, I'm-- -Nuch.

570
43:14.600 --> 43:15.840
Chayanee.

571
43:20.320 --> 43:21.560
I'm moving back home.

572
43:26.040 --> 43:29.120
No. You have to stay here with me.

573
43:29.800 --> 43:31.640
If you never listen to me…

574
43:33.520 --> 43:34.680
then why are we together?

575
43:41.440 --> 43:42.600
All this time,

576
43:43.440 --> 43:46.800
I've given in and bent over backwards for you,

577
43:48.440 --> 43:52.000
but you're just too self-centered. You've never changed anything.

578
43:54.000 --> 43:56.200
I can't take it anymore.

579
43:57.560 --> 44:01.720
No. You can't leave me.

580
44:01.800 --> 44:03.160
We're done.

581
44:04.760 --> 44:08.080
Raiwin, wait.

582
44:08.680 --> 44:12.800
You can't leave. You have to stay with me. I'm not letting you go.

583
44:19.080 --> 44:21.720
-Let go. -I won't let you go.

584
44:25.840 --> 44:28.600
Please don't leave me.

585
44:38.040 --> 44:39.400
Hey!

586
44:39.480 --> 44:43.720
I said come back. Don't leave me.

587
44:45.840 --> 44:47.040
Chayanee.

588
44:52.240 --> 44:53.480
Chayanee.

589
44:56.280 --> 44:59.040
-Miss Chayanee! -Sweetheart.

590
44:59.120 --> 45:02.400
-My dear. -Miss Chayanee.

591
45:02.480 --> 45:04.640
Take her to the hospital.

592
45:06.720 --> 45:08.960
Please help her.

593
45:10.240 --> 45:11.640
Get her to a doctor.

594
45:11.720 --> 45:15.280
Chayanee. Someone help.

595
45:15.360 --> 45:17.000
Oh, sweetheart.

596
45:23.400 --> 45:26.040
Don't get in my way.

597
45:26.120 --> 45:28.640
I need to get clothes for Miss Chayanee.

598
45:28.720 --> 45:30.600
She has to stay in the hospital.

599
45:32.960 --> 45:34.200
What a shame.

600
45:35.080 --> 45:37.080
I thought she had died.

601
45:50.920 --> 45:52.880
I don't understand you.

602
45:54.120 --> 45:55.960
You act sweet and caring toward Ramil,

603
45:56.040 --> 46:00.360
but you keep going after Raiwin too. What exactly do you want?

604
46:00.960 --> 46:02.440
Where should we start?

605
46:03.880 --> 46:05.920
As for Raiwin,

606
46:07.360 --> 46:09.160
I won't ever get back with him.

607
46:10.080 --> 46:12.120
Then why do you keep going after him?

608
46:12.200 --> 46:15.920
I just want to get under Chayanee's skin.

609
46:16.000 --> 46:17.920
And I want revenge on Raiwin

610
46:18.600 --> 46:19.960
for hurting me.

611
46:21.960 --> 46:23.480
I just want him

612
46:24.000 --> 46:26.000
to hurt even more than I did.

613
46:27.400 --> 46:29.880
Revenge isn't going to make you happy.

614
46:32.840 --> 46:34.000
I'm willing to hurt.

615
46:35.880 --> 46:38.240
I have Ramil to heal my wounds.

616
46:39.440 --> 46:40.880
What do you mean?

617
46:41.600 --> 46:43.680
I think Ramil is a good man.

618
46:44.360 --> 46:46.080
Someone I can depend on.

619
46:47.760 --> 46:49.000
So,

620
46:49.840 --> 46:51.960
I want to build a life with him.

621
46:56.400 --> 46:58.840
I don't care whether I'm crossing a line with you.

622
47:01.920 --> 47:05.160
If it makes me happy and helps me survive…

623
47:06.560 --> 47:08.320
I'll fight all the way.

624
47:09.280 --> 47:10.400
For my son.

625
47:16.080 --> 47:17.960
Stop using your son as an excuse.

626
47:18.920 --> 47:20.120
It's just for yourself.

627
47:40.440 --> 47:43.480
So how is Chayanee?

628
47:44.400 --> 47:48.400
Aunt Chamoi said she has to stay in the hospital, but it doesn't seem serious.

629
47:49.000 --> 47:53.520
Does Chayanee have any existing medical condition?

630
47:53.600 --> 47:54.840
No.

631
47:55.640 --> 47:58.600
That's strange. She suddenly fainted.

632
47:59.920 --> 48:01.360
She must have been furious.

633
48:03.040 --> 48:04.200
Ramil.

634
48:04.800 --> 48:08.400
Why did you stop me earlier when I tried to defend Nuchwara?

635
48:09.320 --> 48:14.560
I think it's finally time we told the truth.

636
48:17.480 --> 48:20.840
But if Papang finds out, he'll be shocked and heartbroken.

637
48:22.000 --> 48:24.160
I'll try to explain it to him.

638
48:25.440 --> 48:26.560
Look.

639
48:27.600 --> 48:29.560
We've carried this secret long enough.

640
48:30.640 --> 48:34.640
Everyone has to take responsibility for what they've done.

641
48:51.200 --> 48:52.440
Raiwin.

642
48:54.440 --> 48:56.240
Please don't leave me.

643
48:59.600 --> 49:02.720
Get some rest. I'll come visit you again tomorrow.

644
49:07.680 --> 49:09.600
I'm pregnant.

645
49:14.080 --> 49:19.000
Raiwin, the doctor said Chayanee is three months pregnant.

646
49:22.720 --> 49:24.960
I found out a while ago.

647
49:25.600 --> 49:29.360
I was going to surprise you with the good news, but then this happened.

648
49:30.040 --> 49:32.120
You're going to be a father.

649
49:45.720 --> 49:49.320
If a dog barks at you, you don't bark back. Otherwise, you're no better.

650
49:49.400 --> 49:52.760
I love you. I want to spend my life with you.

651
49:52.840 --> 49:54.920
I'll scrub all the filth out.

652
49:55.000 --> 49:57.000
You have to throw her and her son out.

653
49:57.080 --> 49:58.600
Pong came back to see Liu?

654
49:58.680 --> 50:02.520
Then those two must be working together on something terrible.

655
50:02.600 --> 50:04.320
‎NEXT EPISODE

656
50:04.400 --> 50:06.360
You were trying to make me lose my baby.

657
50:06.440 --> 50:08.720
Chayanee, don't!

658
50:08.800 --> 50:11.880
I was his first wife.

659
50:11.960 --> 50:16.160
I've been doing wrong for far too long. I'm going to make things right.

660
52:08.400 --> 52:12.440
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
